      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Billings%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Residents moved the town to its current location in 1899 because the railroad did not go through the original site.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
