        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Billings%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Billings was named for M. Taylor, the person who helped establish the new townsite in October 1899.",
